//- Timeline: the project's own roadmap (milestones + periods, lanes = repositories)
diagram(layout="timeline" start="2026-10" end="2027-06" scale="month" today="2026-10-15")

  card#launch.milestone(date="2026-10-14") Specs delivered

  zone#router.lane Router
